                                "sense_id": "c8428cd2-5762-30f7-af91-4dd333356c2c",
                                "text": "De helikopters werden ingezet tijdens de reddingsoperaties na de natuurramp.",
                                "translation": "Helicopters were deployed during the rescue operations after the natural disaster.",
                                "english": "Helicopters were deployed during the rescue operations after the natural disaster."
                            },
